--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `return` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Counter {
    public function next(int $n): int {
        retu<|>rn $n + 1;
    }
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
